Package: password-generator
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Password Generator - random password creator
 Password Generator allows you to generate random passwords by
 choosing the size and complexity of the password.
 .
 Features:
  * Selectable character types: lowercase, uppercase, numbers and symbols
  * Adjustable password length (0-64 characters)
  * Passwords drawn from the system's cryptographic random generator
  * Copy to clipboard functionality
  * Deepin desktop integration with native look and feel
